      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know. i'm not... i'm not saying i'm going to do anything right this second. i just mean it feels heavy. like the person i was actually died in that scandal, and this thing left behind is just some empty shell. it's hard to explain how much it hurts to exist when you're just a shadow of what you used to be. it feels like there's no way to go back to being a real person again.",
